   "en": "Gal Oshi JK wa Gal ni Naritai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ギャル推しJKはギャルになりたい"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Gal Oshi JK ha Gal ni Naritai"
   },
   {
    "en": "Gal-Loving JK Wants to Be a Gal"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Living as a gal is seriously the best!!\"\n\nMimiru was an introvert in middle school, but when she entered high school, she made her long-awaited debut as a gal, thinking, \"Maybe I can become a gal too!?\" She made friends with three girls: Yuuhi, a cool beauty with a calm and pretty look; Fuuka, a cute gal with a soft and fluffy look; and Kurumi, a cheerful and energetic gal who is good at sports. Now she has joined the gal group she has always admired! While she lives the sparkling life she has always dreamed of, she also pushes herself too hard to keep up with her friends. And she also notices new feelings growing within her...",
   "ja": "「ギャル擬態生活、マジで最高！！」\n\n中学時代に陰キャだったみみるは、高校入学を機に「私もギャルになれるのでは！？」と念願のギャルデビュー。クールビューティーで落ち着いた綺麗系ギャル、ゆうひ。ふわふわとした柔らかい雰囲気な可愛い系ギャル、ふうか。運動が得意でいつも明るい元気系ギャル、くるみという3人と友人に。これでずっと憧れていたギャルの仲間入り！彼女たちと憧れのキラキラした生活を送る一方で、必死で友人についていこうと無理をしてしまう一面も。そして、自分の中に芽生えた新しい感情にも気が付き…？"
  },
